================================================================================
IMPORTANT — DATA LOSS
================================================================================

The Software stores messages, files and encryption keys encrypted on the local
device only. There is no server, no cloud backup and no recovery service. If a
user loses their password AND their authenticator secret AND all of their recovery
codes, the encrypted data is permanently unrecoverable. This is a deliberate
consequence of the security design and is not a defect.

